; 32.1.4 - Proto-Chatino to Zenzontepec Chatino
; citation: Pogostick Man, from Upson, B.W., and Robert E. Longacre (1965), “Proto-Chatino Phonology”. International Journal of American Linguistics 31(4):312 – 322
; NB: This set is likely very incomplete.
kʲ / tʃ
e / i / l_ when unstressed
e / i / kʲ_ when stressed